@title Pin names: company templates typed in Project > Rules change what Check > Issues calls usual (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Project rules has a "Usual pin names" box. A class typed there replaces the built-in names for its symbol functions. Here motor.ac3 must have the brake pins BD1 BD2, so the motor row of Check > Issues says "brake motor" afterwards. The text is saved in the project as one undo step.
open qa/fixtures/pin-names.kopercad
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text rules
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Usual pin names"
scroll 960 500 -600
wait 10
shot scrolled
click 960 695
wait 5
text class = [{ id = 'motor.brake', label = 'brake motor', functions = ['motor.ac3'], set = [{ name = 'with brake', required = ['U1', 'V1', 'W1', 'BD1', 'BD2'] }] }]
wait 10
shot typed-and-read
expect "1 class read"
click_text "Save pin names"
wait 10
shot saved
click_text "Done"
wait 20
click_text "2 warnings"
wait 20
shot issues-with-company-names
expect "brake motor"
check_layout
